WEBVTT

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:03.130
Summer...

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.800
Sea...

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.360
Exciting dates...

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.630
Naps in the afternoon...

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:18.050
Plenty of shopping, as much as I want!

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:19.540
Nice fireworks...

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.080
Catching goldfish on Matsuri...

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.720
I won’t forget it!!!

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.730
I won’t lose it!

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:29.960
Ahh, what a great summer!

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:46.400
But, but, but... Why are the holidays ending today?!

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:54.200
Every year it’s the same thing...

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:59.470
Why haven’t I done my homework yet?!

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:01.450
I should know better by now!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.670
At this rate,
I’ll never finish my homework.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:13.860
Calm down, Ichigo.

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:17.550
At times like this, drink tea and clear your heart.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.920
Now, I’m at peace again.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:28.380
Argh! My homework won’t get done this way either!

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:36.360
Uh... uh... what to do... what to do...

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:37.950
Oh! I know!

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:42.230
It’s good to have friends.

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:44.800
Oh, hi Moe.

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:47.580
Sorry to bug you, but could you help me with...

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:51.540
Are you dreaming?!

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:55.260
The one that needs help is me!

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:57.920
She’s busy...

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:02.260
Anyways, it’s too early to give up!

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:03.600
Moe isn’t my only friend.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.560
Hi, Miwa...

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:12.450
could you please help me with my homework?

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:13.580
Sure.

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:18.260
Thanks! So it’ll be okay to come over now, right?

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:19.630
Eh? Right now?!

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:21.470
Yup, right now.

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:24.350
...sounds like I’d be an inconvenience.

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:28.290
I can’t help you, because...

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:31.040
Oh? What’s up?

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.550
You see... I’m with my family in Okinawa.

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:45.470
I’m in trouble...

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:50.940
How on Earth can I do all this?

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:52.760
There!

00:02:57.250 --> 00:03:00.530
Masha, solve these math problems!

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:06.410
Masha is a robot, a computer...

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.430
My pet must be able to do it,

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:11.150
it should be done in 5 minutes!

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:17.630
Okay Masha, show your abilities now!

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:42.660
Keep it up!

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:44.600
Masha is done!

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:50.410
Masha is great, Masha is a genius!

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:56.170
It’s my fault I’m in trouble.

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:59.110
I’m so stupid...

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:02.630
Because I waited until the last day,
I have to do it all by myself now!

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:12.100
Argh! I don’t understand it!

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:15.020
I only have my friends now...

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.290
Hi Moe...

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:22.400
sorry to bug you again, but could
you explain something to me?

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:25.880
What?!?! I told you I am not the one to ask for that!

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:29.550
But... I’m really trying to do my homework,

00:04:29.550 --> 00:04:32.410
but I have no idea how to answer it.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:35.100
So how can I get it?

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:36.940
Moe... we’re friends, right?

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:39.400
We’ve been together since 3rd grade.

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:40.920
I’m not happy.

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:45.900
Well, I guess it can’t be helped...

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:47.510
I like you this way!

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:55.440
Tart, what’s this?

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:57.790
It’s made by humans.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:00.250
Good, isn’t it?

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:03.660
Don’t worry. I created a field so they can’t see us.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:06.760
Jeez, even so...

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:09.680
Ack, what’s with the heat here?

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:11.850
Look...

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:17.100
This is the proof of the environment’s destruction.

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:21.860
The ozone is getting weak, and as a result
it’s getting hotter and more humid.

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:26.090
The humans are to blame for this.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:31.810
Humanity will just destroy itself if we leave it to its own devices.{Humans shouldn’t mess with that stuff.}

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:37.770
But, they have some great things too.

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:44.070
Like this...

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.390
Hmm, nice sound.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:48.820
Boring.

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:53.540
Anyway, shouldn’t we proceed
with eradicating the humans?

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.430
I’ll pass.

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:58.000
It’s too hot...

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:03.500
Sorry, same for me.
I have research to do.

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:14.210
Keep up the good work!
Don’t give up!

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:21.610
Hey, wait! Why aren’t you helping?

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:25.570
Geez, what’s with the complaining?

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:30.570
That’s it! The heat has nothing to do with your job!

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:33.800
He saw through it...

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:36.560
and he does have a point.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:38.250
So what do we do?

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:44.520
In that case... How about we decide the way humans do...

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:46.760
with “Rock, Paper, Scissors”.

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:49.600
“Rock, Paper, Scissors”...

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:52.430
As you wish! How about you, Quiche?

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:56.450
What’s “Rock, Paper. Scissors”?

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:59.120
Didn’t you come to Earth
before us?!

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:01.190
And you don’t even know
what that is?!

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:07.280
Ah, I see... That’s easy.

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.820
Good, let’s start.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:12.320
First Round!

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.680
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:17.700
The counter-move!

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:26.810
Well, have fun, Tart!

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:30.360
That Quiche...

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:33.280
He said he didn’t know rock, paper, scissors...

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:36.930
but then he plays so well...

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:59.060
Geez, all that talk about a plan to eradicate humans...

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:04.170
Plus it’s sooo hot!

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:15.090
Shut up!!!

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:23.170
Ah, I have a good idea!

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:40.440
So you see... that time...

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:45.720
It was so funny!!

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:48.300
Ichigo, are you done with your homework already?

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:51.400
Moe, let’s talk again later!

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:53.010
Ok, bye.

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:58.200
Homework, homework, I forgot about my homework!

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:00.510
Have to do it... have to...

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:05.870
Hello?

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:09.670
Ah Ichigo, what kind of gift do you want from Okinawa?

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:13.760
Sorry Miwa. I have to get this done first.

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:18.930
Hello?

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:25.060
Ah, lchigo, we’re going swimming at the club, you want to come?

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.270
Sorry, I can’t...

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:32.010
Yeah, hello?

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:35.650
Ah, Momomiya, are we going to the pool now or not?

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:37.280
I already said I can’t...

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:40.700
Eh? Why not? Today is our last chance.

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:44.180
I’m busy today...

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:50.000
Geez! I said I’m busy now!

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.170
I’m sorry, I’ll hang up.

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:53.300
Aoyama-kun!

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:57.780
I was just... I didn’t mean you!

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:02.180
I was talking to my mom!
Yeah, to my mom! Not to you!

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:04.120
Anyway, what’s up?

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:06.940
Do you have time today?

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:09.230
Yeah! (oops...)

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:13.610
There’s a movie I want to see.  Today is the last day it’s being shown.

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:16.190
So I thought...
How about we go together?

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:19.060
Ah, I see...

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:22.700
What’s wrong?
Do you have other plans?

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:24.350
You don’t have to go, you know.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:28.480
Err... well... well...

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:32.170
Aoyama-kun, did you finish your homework already?

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:36.250
Are you saying you haven’t done it yet?

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:37.150
If so...

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:40.760
No, it’s not like that...
I’m done, I’m done.

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:43.970
So, where should I meet you?

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:47.060
Ok, in front of the train station at 1 PM.

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:49.720
That’s fine, see you then.

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:52.330
What on Earth did I do?

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:55.900
Now what am I going to do about my homework?

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:03.740
It’ll be okay! If I go straight home
after the movie, then I can do it!

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:05.560
Yes, it’ll work!

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.480
I made you wait.

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:20.010
Sorry, did you wait long?

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:22.420
I’d just arrive myself.

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:24.090
That’s good...

00:11:24.090 --> 00:11:25.140
Alright, let’s go.

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:26.020
Ok!

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:30.270
What’s wrong? It’s okay...

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:34.920
Ichigo, help!

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:37.560
What’s going on?

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:38.610
Aliens...?

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:40.930
Retasu! Everyone!

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:43.490
Did something happen?

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:48.210
Yeah... I’m sorry, Aoyama-kun.

00:11:48.210 --> 00:11:51.640
Sounds like my friends
are in trouble... I...

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:54.100
You’d better go...

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:56.090
Thank you!

00:11:57.710 --> 00:11:58.880
Take care!

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:06.430
Oh my, where are they?

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:12.020
Ichigo-oneechan! You came!

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:14.980
They broke the café’s waterpipes.

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:17.000
So, Ichigo, we leave the rest to you!

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:19.380
What about... the aliens...?

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:22.410
What are you talking about?

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:23.990
You saved us,

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:27.350
we can repair the waterpipes now.

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:31.310
And you can do something about the water...

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:36.520
I’m going back!!!

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:39.990
What?

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:41.740
We won’t let you go!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:45.070
We can’t clean up the water
without you.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:46.910
Give up...

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:49.870
Ah! That’s... that’s...!!!

00:12:57.770 --> 00:12:59.800
We’re sort of done cleaning...

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.400
Hmm, when I think about it,

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:09.070
this situation could be quite useful...

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:10.220
My targets are...

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:14.750
I can’t count on Bu-Ling, she’s still in junior high... but...

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:17.280
My glasses! My glasses!

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:20.980
Retasu is great with everything,
I’m sure even with my homework.

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.200
And...

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:25.700
Minto receives regular tuition from private home tutors.

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:30.140
Zakura-san is, well, I guess she’s my best bet.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:31.870
Okay, let’s go.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:34.600
Zakuro-san!

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:38.760
Uhm, I have a small favor to ask...

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:42.060
Well, you see, school starts again tomorrow,

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:44.690
and we had lots of homework over vacation...

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:46.900
I really wanted to do it all

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:50.100
but I was busy protecting the Earth.

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:50.100
So?

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:53.330
Please, Zakuro-san, help me
with my homework!

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:54.970
No...

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:58.190
I guess she’s not the type who tutors people...

00:13:58.600 --> 00:13:59.120
Please, Minto.

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:00.540
Please, Minto.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:03.660
Oh? l’d never imagine there’d be
a time when you’d ask me...

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:07.300
You’ll have to convince me.

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:08.630
Let’s see...

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:13.090
If you pay me 800 yen for each subject,
I might just consider it.

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:16.620
800?? I’m not an idiot...

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:19.730
Please, Retasu, help me.

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:25.130
Uhm, Ichigo-san, you’re supposed to
do your homework on your own...

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:30.360
That’s why, I can’t help you...

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:33.070
I’m sorry, really really sorry.

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:34.820
Sorry... sorry...

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:34.820
It’s okay...

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:35.810
Who’s left?

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:39.600
Sure, no big deal.

00:14:40.010 --> 00:14:41.790
What? Really?!

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.750
As much as I’d like to,

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:49.280
I was asked to participate in a Chef’s Food Tournament...

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:53.080
Akasaka-san, what...?

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:57.220
How about asking Ryou?

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:58.410
Bye...

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.900
What? It’s okay?

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:10.160
2000 yen for each subject.

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:15.370
Why? You’re so mean!

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:18.770
Since I’m working, it’s only right that I get paid.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:22.480
Anyway, homework is something
you should do on your own.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:26.440
No, no, no, no!

00:15:26.870 --> 00:15:28.950
Chimera Anima! Chimera Anima!

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:32.700
You can’t fool me again!

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:43.450
What’s that?

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:45.600
It hurts!

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:46.960
Let’s go!

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:54.700
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:59.960
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:05.610
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:10.390
Mew Mew Pomegranate METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:17.160
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:30.960
Where is the Chimera Anima?

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:32.030
There!

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:35.120
Ah! A huge insect?

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:39.100
Shut up!

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:44.350
You there, be quiet!

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:47.460
This time the Chimera Anima
is a cicada.

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:49.500
It seems weak.

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:53.590
Yeah, it’d be nice to beat something a bit stronger.

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:55.320
Quiet, you!

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:58.280
You came fast,
even though it’s so hot.

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:00.240
Tart!

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:02.930
Why did you summon that
Chimera Anima?!

00:17:02.930 --> 00:17:05.670
Admit it, you’re just trying
to annoy us.

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:09.340
Yes, I’m very busy right now!

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:11.580
Yeah...

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:14.980
Actually, I didn’t come to fight today...

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:17.050
and it’s hot,

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:18.300
so I guess I’ll go home.

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:21.260
That’s so unnecessary and honest...

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:24.770
You have no reason to talk!

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.770
Go, Chimera Anima!

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:53.990
There!

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:55.680
The wings! What...?

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:12.190
This hurts too much!

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:14.150
If this continues...

00:18:15.040 --> 00:18:16.360
That’s not funny!

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:20.910
Ichigo...

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:25.120
Sorry, I don’t have time to play!

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:28.580
I have to defeat it now!

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:30.040
What?

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:36.170
I still have summer homework to do!

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:57.490
Reborn Strawberry Flash!

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:06.970
Mew Strawberry!

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:09.000
You saved us!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:09.910
Awesome!

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:12.080
Everyone!

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:16.240
What? You haven’t done your summer homework yet?

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:18.510
You don’t have to mention it!

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:20.730
I’ll be going now.

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:23.390
But, before that,

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.890
go Chimera Cicadas!

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:38.320
Well, do your best!

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:43.290
What does he mean?

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:47.050
...that we have to fight the other cicadas as well.

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:51.000
And that they’ll keep you from doing your homework.

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:53.710
That kid planned this well...

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:58.420
I don’t have time for this!
What about my homework?

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:02.360
Give it up! This is for
the world’s sake!

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:05.350
At this rate, you’ll have to
forget about it.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:06.680
Let’s go.

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:08.600
Hey!

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:19.260
Please, someone help me!!!

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:26.990
Hey, Moe...

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.880
Did they come here because they fell in love?

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:32.100
We need someone to play Cupid, that’s for sure!

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:35.770
Well, our Cupid is Ichigo, right?

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:37.600
Err, sounds like a bad omen for them...

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:42.630
Don’t say that! You have to cooperate!

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:44.360
Next time: Sudden Love.

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:46.780
Reaching a Girl’s Heart

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:50.410
Okay! Leave everything to me!

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:52.340
That doesn’t sound so promising....
